{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"Constable Buchanan is the evening lamplighter in charge of this station.","created_at":"2021-07-11T03:54:47.987000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863629373026074636","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"<@!185916549066915852> <@!443806147649208341>","created_at":"2021-07-11T03:54:57.567000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863629413207638076","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Greetings! Constable Buchanan, is it?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:07:26.299000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863632553617653761","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"It is\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:15:11.777000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T04:15:41.137000Z","id":"863634505972711444","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"and you are?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:15:31.175000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863634587333689364","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I am Apgan, of the Tatankan. I'll let my friend introduce themselves.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:16:27.139000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863634822064635905","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"Ed was casually laying against the wall closest and then stands upright and with a small bow says \"Edward Harkness is my name\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:17:07.409000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863634990969389087","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Humph.\" He looks at the unlikely pair. \"And what brings you by our humble station?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:18:06.891000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863635240454586378","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"We were hoping to inquire about the Clutter's. To be of what assistance we might.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:18:19.374000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863635292811558922","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"We have been looking into their history--the history of their objects, that is.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:18:44.743000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863635399217774613","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Ah yes.\" His lantern hood raises suspiciously. \"Inquiring into the history of an object is, as I well know and incredibly... prickly topic. Hmm.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:20:34.521000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863635859659292703","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I have a lead or two, but it would be useful to come prepared with whatever the lamplighters know about the Clutters' and their objects.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:22:28.646000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863636338334629898","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I can tell you about the parents... but I wouldn't want to talk about the children with out permission from their family.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:23:17.165000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863636541838327848","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"That will do for the moment.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:23:56.194000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863636705537556511","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"Ed nods in agreement","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:24:15.171000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T04:24:21.353000Z","id":"863636785132339220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"The father was a bent bayonet.","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:24:55.130000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T04:25:45.304000Z","id":"863636952733843476","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"A bit rusted but trusty.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:25:08.490000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T04:25:40.461000Z","id":"863637008768040980","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"And the mother was a piece of costume jewlery. Sad story that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:25:36.736000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863637127241007115","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"There was a woman who borrowed it from a rich friend. But it broke. So she took out a loan to purchase a replacement, but one made of actual silver and jewels. She spent the rest of her life trying to pay off that loan.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:27:11.848000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863637526170173440","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"My, so we already know the mother's history. Thank you very much.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:28:25.726000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863637836036702218","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"But I must say I am unfamiliar with Living Shadow's family dynamics. What does it mean to be a child?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:29:02.010000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863637988223352854","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Or a parent for that matter. It was my understanding that a Shade generated from a sentimental object.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:29:53.460000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T04:30:19.800000Z","id":"863638204019507220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Sometimes it means that the memory is less intense, and will take longer to mature. Other times it is because it is a child's memory.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:30:39.252000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863638396084551710","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"As to how parents and children end up together. That is a question for huginn and muninn.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:31:13.530000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863638539857821736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I understand. Would it be all right if we got the name of the woman who took out the loan, or of her rich friend?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:32:23.641000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863638833924276264","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Friend seems such a strong word, in these circumstances.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:32:45.911000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863638927331295272","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I understand your thinking, but both of those women are long passed on.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:35:48.189000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863639691860377620","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"And I don't think she ever shared it with me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:36:03.599000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863639756495388672","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
