{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"this is fine. everything is fine.","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:37:20.760000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863640080132472832","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"And the bayonet, were you able to find out who it belonged to?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:39:02.681000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863640507619213313","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Or at least what side they were on?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:39:10.906000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863640542117232652","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"A soldier. One of ours. Left it out on the border before the ravens brought the noir.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:39:59.278000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863640745005154324","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"Ed is looking inside his pockets for any piece of paper on which to write all this down.","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:41:07.151000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863641029683838977","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"My condolences for your loss. It must have been some comfort to know he lived on through his bayonet, for the time that he did.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:42:39.882000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863641418627022878","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"My thanks.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:43:08.147000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863641537178238986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Was there anything else before I head out on my rounds?\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:43:25.849000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863641611425415208","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Only if my friend has something to ask; I have to get going myself, curfew's coming down, and I'm docked over at the airport.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:43:55.706000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863641736655929346","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"This friend trusts you have asked much better questions than I could have, and I'm much thankful for him\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:44:40.604000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863641924971134986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Let's head out then.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:45:00.921000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-11T04:45:20.817000Z","id":"863642010187464714","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Good night to you then.\"","created_at":"2021-07-11T04:46:47.698000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863642458041352203","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
