{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"Mictlan ponders as they enter. \"Excuse. Me. I noticed. A notice board. And was wondering. If there was. Additional. Information. About the lost. Objects.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:02:48.355000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864612854970712064","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
