{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Hello.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:03:27.177000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864613017803161600","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"He his fully covered except for two clouded, white eyes, \"Ye saw the board, are ye going to be investigating the happenings about here?\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:04:22.794000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864613251076980736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I suppose. Yes. The separation. Of a family. Is a tragedy,\" dozens of eyes glitter at Tortillini from practically every bit of exposed skin and feathers.","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:06:01.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864613664761053254","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Be ye needin' help with that me friend? I've been lookin for someone vith knowledge about such investagations ta lend me assistance\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:07:39.252000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864614075082211340","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I can. Find things. Better than others. Yes,\" Mictlan nods, fluffing their feathers out with what could be a slight frown. \"Assistance. Would be. Appreciated.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:09:06.109000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864614439386349599","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Ta name be Tortillini, Cap'n o' the Revanants. At yer service.\" He bows emphatically","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:09:50.948000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864614627454222386","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"What is. A revenant,\" Mictlan tilts their head slightly to one side, face-wings fluttering almost for balance. \"You can. Call me. Mictlan.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:10:45.174000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864614854894813205","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"A pleasure Mictlan. Someone twice dead by me definition.\" He winks","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:12:11.354000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864615216360718356","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Ah. I am only. Once dead,\" Mictlan nods wisely. \"Do you. Have. An idea. On where. To start looking. After this.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:14:00.465000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864615674004766741","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I'd say ve should ask about in the market to see if anyone has seen corpses thrown about.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:16:18.081000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864616251208368128","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"That. Makes sense. I was hoping. To ask. Here first. To see. If anyone knows more. About the family. And what everything would. Look like.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:17:02.445000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864616437285126144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
