{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Hello,\" Mictlan says with a smile. So plants are sentient, but lamps and stuff are too. They can understand that. \"I was wondering. If you knew more. About the Clutter. Family.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:45:04.457000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864623492153868318","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Clutter. Ah, that was some bad business\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:46:59.491000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864623974642221126","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Yes. We were hoping. To find. Them.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:47:20.100000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864624061082632212","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I'm sorry, but they have been murdered.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:47:57.074000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T21:48:06.956000Z","id":"864624216162435152","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"And their internment has been... Disturbed.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:48:30.437000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864624356097523722","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"I would bring you to the family urns, but they are evidence at the moment.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:49:26.226000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864624590092107806","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Yes,\" they say, patiently. Mictlan is used to not being good at English. \"Er. I meant. I saw. The bulletin board. And was hoping. To find. The things. That have been lost.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:51:10.267000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864625026471559198","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"Tortillini picks up one of those glass paperweights if there is one and holds it up to the light before setting it back down as they converse","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:52:38.329000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864625395831013387","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Oh. I hadn't dared to hope someone would dane to help.","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:53:05.915000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864625511535738890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Ve be daning alright.\" He walks back up to stand with Mictlan","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:53:30.551000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T21:53:53.145000Z","id":"864625614866481193","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Well, I thank you for your efforts. I do hope they won't be futile.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:54:38.778000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T21:55:21.994000Z","id":"864625901030998047","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Plague","id":"476553068687654922","is_bot":0,"username":"__plague"},"author_id":"476553068687654922","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Yes. Can you tell us. Anything about the family. Other than. Is on the bulletin. Already.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:55:58.203000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864626234162675733","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"What? Ah. There was that grizzly buisness at the Umbral cup. All four killed on the same night.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:58:16.428000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864626813921394709","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Tragedy that the kids were killed too.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:58:39.237000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864626909588357141","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Local family. Quick on their way to becoming full shadows.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:59:34.596000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864627141780832256","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
