{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"850792255224152104","content":"\"Ah, yes. Objects left in the noir can sometimes come to life. They anthropomorphize. Like myself. When they are done, they become born into their next life as shadows. The shadow born.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T22:01:50.943000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-13T22:02:24.141000Z","id":"864627713661468672","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
